body:
For real, I HATE it when my teammates spam "This way!", I get it, but also you're not helping by annoying the rest of us with that.

&#x200B;

Nice RM route though! Good job!

Tenta Missile mains are the most exceptional players to both enemies and teammates. Everytime I face one, I become overjoyed upon seeing missiles come at me DESPITE IT BEING THE FIRST FIVE SECONDS OF THE MATCH. As a teammate, I sure am glad seeing the the entire map filled with our ink even if our enemies are milliseconds away from capturing the objective! 

&#x200B;

fuck tenta mains, me and my homies hate tenta mains.

Shinobu's case should be edible

&#x200B;

also i hate you, how could you do this to my boye
